690	  // both meant a generic, invoice-less "your Nxeon order" receipt landed right
691	  // before the real invoice on every PayPal/Coinbase purchase — the exact
692	  // "this email is weak" duplication already removed from the Stripe path in
693	  // creditCheckoutSession.
