1456	    // is eventually spent on; inventing a top-up document at that point would
1457	    // double-count the same dollars all over again the moment they deploy.
1458	    // Remember WHERE in the batch this lands, so the created row's id can be read
1459	    // back out of the transaction result. The receipt email promises the customer
